  "notes": {
    "tone": "Calm, precise, and motion-led. The curve is the model.",
    "pacing": "The same curve-world persists: examples appear, the curve adjusts, error shrinks, the curve stabilizes, and an unseen point reads from it.",
    "animation_guidelines": "No boxes, cards, flow arrows, panels, persistent mode labels, or summary slides. Training is curve adjustment; inference is using the fixed curve; generalization is the unseen point still making sense."
  }
